- P1 now has a clear, optimal move: play `P1_Card3`.
- P1 also knows to hold onto `P1_Card5` as it has been explicitly identified.
- P1 can confidently ignore their other cards (`P1_Card1`, `P1_Card2`, `P1_Card4`) for playing, as they have no positive information about them and now know they are not Yellow.

