**Strategic Implications & Shared Mental Model:**
- **My Next Action:** My path is clear. I will play card 4 on my turn.
- **Team Coordination:** P1 has successfully communicated the optimal move. We are now synchronized. P1 knows that I know card 4 is playable and that my other cards are not 1s. This shared understanding allows P1 to plan their next turn, knowing I will successfully advance the fireworks. This clue was an efficient use of a token to guarantee progress and provide valuable negative information for my future decisions.

